[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0010","text":"────哎呀，摩美美\n你学过小号吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0020","text":"……只是在看教程书啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0030","text":"吹不响嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0040","text":"……欧帕恰马啦多，欧帕恰马啦多"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0050","text":"这是咒语哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0060","text":"什么意思？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0070","text":"意思是──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0080","text":"“……朋友啊”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0090","text":"“────朋友啊，一步一步走吧”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0100","text":"走掉了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0110","text":"接下来要踏上充满“恐惧”和“混乱”的旅程了呢……\n独自一人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0120","text":"……果穗，\n你以前有过真正独自一人的时候吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0130","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0140","text":"面对巨大挑战的时候，叩响新的大门的时候……\n果穗有过独自一人的时候吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0150","text":"没、没有……！　一直都有制作人\n和大家陪着我……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0160","text":"……是吗是吗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0170","text":"呵呵……探测器也在一起呢！\n就算看起来是一个人，也不是一个人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0180","text":"至今为止遇见的，\n好多好多的人都在为你加油呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0190","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0200","text":"……所以，未来不可怕"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0210","text":"……你们不会想着“差不多就行了”吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0220","text":"你平时一直都在练习的吧～？\n练了好多好多～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0230","text":"……因为我从来没觉得已经足够了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0240","text":"……也就是说，你相信自己还能做得更好～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0250","text":"我倒没这么想过"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0260","text":"那你呢，你不相信自己吗？\n不相信自己"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0270","text":"……啊～～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0280","text":"────不存在什么极限"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0290","text":"别以为见识了世界，就觉得自己变聪明了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0300","text":"那种所谓的“分寸”根本不需要知道"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0310","text":"────我们“成为了偶像”……在那之后"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0320","text":"就算满身泥泞，也绝对想要得到的东西……你有吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0330","text":"……没有，吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0340","text":"………………还没找到，吧──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0350","text":"从“现在”走向“未来”────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0360","text":"想要什么　想实现什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0370","text":"必须踏上寻找答案的旅程"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0016","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0380","text":"……啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0017","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0390","text":"辛、辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0018","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0019","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0400","text":"喂"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0410","text":"你在躲我吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0023","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0420","text":"不、不是\n不是那样的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0430","text":"骗人的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0440","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0024","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0025","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0450","text":"那个／我说啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0460","text":"！／……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0026","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0027","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0028","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0029","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0470","text":"28个人──────在这里的，大家一起"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0480","text":"欧帕卡玛拉德……、………────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0490","text":"凉凉的　对吧　正合脚\n今夜　带我远去的鞋"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_99_0500","text":"没错　驰骋在蓝色的晚霞中\n没错　无论多远都能抵达"}]
